PTX MP+cache-operators
"Cache operators are performance hints only (15572): .cg/.cs do not change the verdict of MP+rel-acq. Expected: forbidden."
{
x=0;
f=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0         | P1@cta 1,gpu 0          ;
 st.weak.global.cs x, 1 | ld.acquire.gpu r0, f    ;
 st.release.gpu f, 1    | ld.weak.global.cg r1, x ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
